{
  "name": "Bucket Customer",
  "description": "A large customer that occupies two stacked queue slots in a lane and must be fed several times the marbles of a normal order before it clears. Each bucket's capacity is a multiple of 3 (6 to 30), set per bucket in the level editor.",
